<title>UK: UK Sept non-EU trade deficit 851 mln stg.</title>
<headline>UK Sept non-EU trade deficit 851 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Office for National Statistics released following seasonally adjusted UK non-EU Trade data-</p>
<p>    UK TRADE NON-EU (in million stg)    SEPT     AUG    (PREL AUG)</p>
<p>    Trade balance			 -851    -597	(-499)</p>
<p>    Exports (FOB)			 5,920    6,014   (6,118)</p>
<p>    Imports (FOB)			 6,771    6,611   (6,617)</p>
<p>    Oil exports			     260	209     (209)</p>
<p>    Oil imports			     371	347     (347)</p>
<p>    Trade balance 3m ending	  -2,167	n/a  (-2,077)</p>
<p>NOTE - Consensus forecast 685 million stg deficit.</p>
</text>
